    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Case Kovacs - Agent 228</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u> ... is a prelude to the game NoseBound.</u> This very short and intriguing mini game tell the story of Elizabeth Kovacs, the missing woman from the story NoseBound. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please consider the fact that we made this game mostly to test gameplay mechanics in Unreal Engine, exploring new tools, etc. The gameplay, although still point &amp; click, is very different. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a possibility to extend this title onto a fully developed game once NoseBound is released if there's enough interest.</p>",
